;   51
;   52    ! Each message: its severity, its identifier, and its text, in which !AS
;   53    ! stands for the text the error names (VMS's notation for "a string
;   54    ! argument here"). TYPE ... END TYPE defines a derived type, a record of
;   55    ! named components; a component is reached with %, as messages(k)%text.
;   56    type message
